window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>My happiness and joy were ripped from me in a matter of seconds.</p> <p>My men avenge me like they always do, but a part of me is still broken.</p> <p>A piece of me is missing. And I don’t think I’ll ever be whole again until I can fill it.</p> <p>I’ve changed, that much I know. I’m a woman on a mission and I’ll do anything it takes to give my men what they need.</p> <p>Life goes on like normal, we’re all dealing with things in our own way or so that’s what I’ve tricked myself into thinking, when an unexpected guest comes into our lives.</p> <p>He changes my whole world, giving it a new meaning I didn’t know how badly I needed.</p> <p>With our lives changing drastically so quickly, the guys are learning to adjust while still running one of the biggest, deadliest crews on this side of the country.</p> <p>Some things will never change. They’re still my dark, depraved soldiers and I wouldn’t have them any other way.</p> <p>But even though we’ve defeated one monster, there’s always more lurking in the shadows.</p> <p>Will the guys be able to protect me this time? Or will the past finally come to get me?</p> <p>Even with all the uncertainty around us, one thing I know for sure is, We’re Black Venom Crew. We’re strong and this will not break us.</p>"; 
